# Never commit prompt-string OVERRIDE files (runtime overrides / scratch prompt dirs).
# The canonical extraction prompts ARE committed as .md (single source of truth, D-5.6):
# source of truth = wevibe-mcp/prompts/; vendored + go:embed'd into the hub (synced via
# `make sync-extraction-prompts`). The hub embed dir below is force-included.
prompts/
!wevibe-hub/internal/api/handlers/prompts/
!wevibe-hub/internal/api/handlers/prompts/**
WEVIBE_EXTRACTION_PROMPT
WEVIBE_KEYWORD_PROMPT
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.backup
target/
pkg/
node_modules/
*.js.map
# compiled binaries (not the directory)
# compiled binaries only (not the wevibe-hub/ directory)
/wevibe-hub
/wevibe-hub-static
/wevibe-hub-test
.DS_Store
*.lock
!wevibe-hub/
# TypeScript build artifacts
wevibe-dashboard/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# compiled hub binary
wevibe-hub/wevibe-hub

# Local orchestration docs (never committed)
AGENTS.md
MANAGER.md
WORKER.md
SESSIONCONTINUANCE.md
handlers.test
*.test

